    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are ghost hunters.</h2>A game in which you catch ghosts and with some chance you can get the caught ghost into your Steam inventory. Collect as many ghosts as possible!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061430/extras/febe77e44a497673ffc9d44f75e3d2c7.avif?t=1726604787\" width=640 height=236 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We Have</h2><strong>Various types of ghosts</strong> - there will be more than 50 types in the game, but you will only have to catch selected ghosts.<br><strong>Falling system</strong> - with each click you increase the chance of finding the ghost you need, which you can get in your inventory!<br><strong>The best market economy</strong> - we don\u2019t flood the market with &quot;hundreds&quot; of items like other developers because <i>we do NOT operate on the principles of a financial pyramid.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061430/extras/4362f865836bd5d6bd95c01c3da55246.avif?t=1726604787\" width=640 height=236 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invite friends</h2>Play with friends and get a bonus for each friend you invite!<br><br>good luck and dont get rect ;)<br><br>, dyor",
